('UI/UX DESIGN', 95, 'Detail-oriented UI/UX designer with a strong focus on user-centered design principles. Adept at crafting intuitive, visually compelling interfaces that balance functionality with aesthetics. Experienced in translating user needs into seamless digital experiences through wireframing, prototyping, and usability testing. Passionate about staying current with design trends and emerging tools to drive innovation and enhance product usability.'),
